OL,3,AOvarian cancer and menopause at 19 mean
OL,4,AI can't have kids, but it's changed me
OL,5,Afor the better
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Enlli Thompson's periods changed
OL,8,Fand she began experiencing excruciating
OL,9,Fpain at 19, she was told by doctors
OL,10,Fthere was nothing wrong.
OL,12,FHer stomach issues and headaches were
OL,13,Fblamed on a bug or a urinary infection
OL,14,F- even anxiety.
OL,16,FIt was only after Enlli had further
OL,17,Ftests when a scan showed a cyst in her
OL,18,Fpelvis that the teenager from
OL,19,FCaernarfon, Gwynedd, was given the
OL,20,Fdevastating news she had ovarian
OL,21,Fcancer.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
