OL,3,AOvarian cancer and menopause at 19 mean
OL,4,AI can't have kids, but it's changed me
OL,5,Afor the better
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe would need a full hysterectomy to
OL,8,Fremove her womb, which would put her
OL,9,Finto immediate menopause, and means she
OL,10,Fis not able to have children.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
